  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance for Government Debt and Infrastructure Finance - Madagascar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support the Ministry of Finance and Budget in 1. broadening the investment base for domestic government securities in order to ensure adequate domestic financing for budget deficits and investment and 2. promoting greater clarity of debt management objectives and build a capacity to better manage and mitigate debt portfolio risks.</narrative>
  </description>
